{
  "slug": "aurakit",
  "name": "Aurakit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Sonnet Amplified fullstack development engine. Single /aura\ncommand activates 34 modes (BUILD, FIX, CLEAN, DEPLOY, REVIEW +\n28 extended). Features 5-step Sonnet Amplifier for Opus-level\ncode quality, SEC-01~15 OWASP-complete security rules, 13\nruntime hooks for zero-token enforcement, Tiered Model\n(ECO/PRO/MAX) with automatic model selection, 75% verified\ntoken reduction, 10 language-specific code reviewers, 5\nframework patterns, Instinct learning engine, and 8-language UI\nsupport.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **23 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `aura` (All-in-one fullstack dev engine), `aura-compact` (스냅샷 저장 + /compact 안내), `aura-guard` (토큰 예산 모니터)\n- **Agents** (23): `annotator` (@AX 어노테이션 전문가), `architect` (시스템 아키텍처 설계 전문가), `debugger` (체계적 디버깅 전문가), `deep-worker` (복잡한 단일 태스크 전문가), `devops` (DevOps/인프라 전문가), `executor` (코드 구현 전문가), `explorer` (코드베이스 탐색 전문가), `frontend-specialist` (프론트엔드 전문가), and 15 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install aurakit@claude-community` from `smorky850612/Aurakit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "agent": 23
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
